<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices - Feb 4.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices - Feb 4.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Wheat Board international card prices for wheat exports for Feb 4.</p>
<p>In U.S. dollars per tonne, FOB eastern states.</p>
<p>		ASW	  AH     PH 13 PCT PH 14 PCT</p>
<p>    Feb    197.00    201.50    204.50    215.50</p>
<p>    Mar    197.00    201.50    204.50    215.50</p>
<p>    Apr    196.00    201.50    203.50    215.50</p>
<p>    May    196.00    201.50    203.50    215.50</p>
<p>    Jun    196.00    201.50    203.50    215.50</p>
<p>    Jul    194.50    199.00    202.00    214.00</p>
<p>Note: ASW = Australian Standard White; AH = Australian Hard; PH = Australian Prime Hard; percentages = protein content.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
